---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import TelegramCTA from "../../components/TelegramCTA.astro";
import Quiz from "../../components/Quiz.astro";
const title = "AutoCAD on Mac — O'rganamiz";
const description = "Mac'da AutoCAD: o'rnatish, interfeys farqlari, asosiy chizish buyruqlari va bepul talaba litsenziyasi.";
const questions = [
  { q: "Mac'da AutoCAD ishlatish uchun nima kerak?", opts: ["Windows .exe fayli", "AutoCAD for Mac (macOS versiyasi)", "Android ilovasi", "Faqat brauzer"], answer: 1 },
  { q: "Buyruqlar satrini Mac'da ko'rsatish/yashirish shortcut'i?", opts: ["Command+9", "Ctrl+9", "Alt+9", "Command+1"], answer: 0 },
  { q: "Bepul talaba litsenziyasi qayerdan olinadi?", opts: ["edu.autodesk.com", "apple.com", "github.com", "microsoft.com"], answer: 0 }
];
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>

<article class="lesson">
  <div class="course-hero">
    <h1>AutoCAD on Mac</h1>
    <div class="price">
      <span class="now">$29</span>
      <span class="old">$49</span>
      <span class="badge badge-new">-41%</span>
      <span class="badge badge-cert">Sertifikat</span>
      <span class="uzs">≈ 360 000 so'm</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="lead">
    <span data-i18n="ac.lead1">Mac'da AutoCAD bilan ishlash — Windows'dan farqli o'ziga xos xususiyatlarga ega. Bu kursda o'rnatish, interfeys, asosiy buyruqlar va Autodesk'dan</span> <b data-i18n="ac.leadBold">bepul talaba litsenziyasi</b> <span data-i18n="ac.lead2">qanday olinishini o'rganasiz.</span>
  </p>

  <section>
    <h2 data-i18n="ac.modules">Kurs modullari</h2>
    <ol class="modules">
      <li data-i18n="ac.mod1">Mac'da o'rnatish — AutoCAD for Mac, tizim talablari (macOS 12+)</li>
      <li data-i18n="ac.mod2">Interfeys farqlari (Mac vs Windows) va Mac-specific shortcut'lar</li>
      <li data-i18n="ac.mod3">Asosiy chizish buyruqlari — LINE, CIRCLE, TRIM, OFFSET, LAYER</li>
      <li data-i18n="ac.mod4">8-qadamli workflow: UNITS → LIMITS → LAYER → chizish → PLOT</li>
      <li data-i18n="ac.mod5">Autodesk bepul talaba litsenziyasi (edu.autodesk.com) — 1 yilga</li>
      <li data-i18n="ac.mod6">Amaliy loyiha — birinchi chizmani Model'dan Layout'ga chiqarish</li>
      <li data-i18n="ac.mod7">Pro tips — CUI sozlamalari, OSNAP, suv belgisi (watermark) haqida</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>1. Mac'da o'rnatish va interfeys</h2>
    <p>
      Autodesk'dan Mac uchun maxsus <b>AutoCAD for Mac</b> versiyasini yuklab oling —
      Windows <code>.exe</code> fayli Mac'da ishlamaydi. Tizim talabi: macOS 12 (Monterey)
      yoki undan yangiroq, ~4 GB bo'sh joy. O'rnatishdan oldin Autodesk hisobingiz
      bo'lishi kerak (qarang: 5-modul, bepul litsenziya).
    </p>
    <h3>Asosiy farqlar</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Buyruqlar satri: Windows'da <code>Ctrl+9</code>, Mac'da <b>Command+9</b></li>
      <li>Hotkey: <code>Ctrl+C</code> o'rniga <b>Command+C</b> (Mac'da odat)</li>
      <li>Asosiy menyu: Ribbon o'rniga Mac menyusi + Tool Set (ChZPP)</li>
      <li>Tashqi fayl: <code>.WMF</code> yo'q — PDF yoki PNG ishlating</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="quiz-hint">Eng katta odat o'zgarishi — <b>Ctrl → Command</b>. Shortcut'larni <code>CUI</code> orqali moslashtirish mumkin.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>2. Asosiy chizish buyruqlari va workflow</h2>
    <p>Eng ko'p ishlatiladigan buyruqlar: <code>L</code> (LINE), <code>C</code> (CIRCLE),
      <code>REC</code> (RECTANGLE), <code>TR</code> (TRIM), <code>O</code> (OFFSET),
      <code>LA</code> (LAYER), <code>DLI</code>/<code>DRA</code> (o'lcham).</p>
    <p>Tavsiya etilgan workflow ketma-ketligi: <b>UNITS → LIMITS → LAYER → chizish →
      tahrirlash → annotatsiya → Layout → PLOT</b>. Har doim <b>OSNAP</b> yoqib qo'ying —
      nuqtalar aniq ulanishi uchun.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>3. Autodesk'dan bepul talaba litsenziyasi</h2>
    <p>
      Bu — <b>rasmiy va bepul</b> yo'l. <code>education.autodesk.com</code> sahifasiga o'ting,
      talaba sifatida ro'yxatdan o'ting va tasdiqlang (.edu email yoki tasdiqlovchi hujjat bilan).
      Litsenziya odatda <b>1 yil</b> amal qiladi va qayta tasdiqlash orqali uzaytiriladi.
      Chiqarilgan chizmalarda "Educational" suv belgisi bo'lishi mumkin — bu tijorat uchun emas,
      o'quv maqsadida.
    </p>
    <p class="quiz-hint">Hech qanday crack shart emas — bu yo'l qonuniy va bepul.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Tashqi manbalar orqali o'rganish — Jaycad (YouTube) + Autodesk</h2>
    <p>
      Quyidagi o'quv yo'li <b>Jay Cad</b> kanalidagi "AutoCAD Mac Course — Zero To Hero"
      (6 bo'lim, 67 dars) va <b>Autodesk</b> rasmiy sahifalari asosida tuzilgan. Har bir
      bo'limda tegishli darsga havola va o'z so'zlarim bilan qisqacha izoh berilgan. YouTube
      avtomatik ro'yxatlash cheklovi tufayli har bir dars alohida emas, kanal darajasida
      bog'langan — kerakli bo'limni kanal ichidan topishingiz mumkin.
    </p>

    <h3>0-bo'lim — O'rnatish va bepul talaba litsenziyasi</h3>
    <p>
      Ushbu bo'limda Autodesk'ning rasmiy "How do I install AutoCAD for MAC" va "Education"
      sahifalaridan foydalaning.
    </p>
    <p>
      Mac uchun alohida "AutoCAD for Mac" build kerak (Windows <code>.exe</code> fayli Mac'da
      ishlamaydi). Talabalar <code>education.autodesk.com</code> orqali ro'yxatdan o'tib, .edu
      email yoki talaba hujjati bilan tasdiqlanib, 1 yillik bepul litsenziya oladi — bu pullik
      $1,690/yil versiyasidan qonuniy va bepul alternativa.
    </p>
    <p class="src">manba: Autodesk — Install AutoCAD for Mac, <a href="https://www.autodesk.com/support/technical/article/caas/sfdcarticles/sfdcarticles/How-do-I-install-AutoCAD-for-MAC.html">havola</a> ; Autodesk Education, <a href="https://www.autodesk.com/education/edu-software/overview">havola</a></p>

    <h3>1-bo'lim — Asoslar (The Essentials, Lectures 1–9)</h3>
    <p>
      Ushbu bo'limda Jay Cad'ning "AutoCAD Mac Course — Zero To Hero" kursining 1-bo'limi
      (Introduction → Importing Dimension Styles) darslaridan foydalaning:
      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/jaycad">youtube.com/jaycad</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Bu bo'lim dastur bilan birinchi tanishuv — status bar, birlik sozlamalari va eng ko'p
      ishlatiladigan chizish/tahrirlash buyruqlari. Oxirida o'lchamlar (dimensions) va ularning
      uslublarini import qilish ko'rsatiladi.
    </p>
    <p class="src">manba: Jay Cad (YouTube), <a href="https://www.youtube.com/jaycad">youtube.com/jaycad</a> ; Autodesk — Beginner Tutorials for AutoCAD for Mac, <a href="https://www.autodesk.com/support/technical/article/caas/sfdcarticles/sfdcarticles/Beginner-Tutorials-for-AutoCAD-for-Mac.html">havola</a></p>

    <h3>2-bo'lim — Loyihani boshlash (Starting with The Project, Lectures 10–15)</h3>
    <p>
      Ushbu bo'limda Jay Cad'ning kursining 2-bo'limi (Customizing Shortcuts → Importing Text
      Styles) darslaridan foydalaning:
      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/jaycad">youtube.com/jaycad</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Haqiqiy loyiha ustida ishlash boshlanadi — devorlar offset orqali qalinlashtiriladi,
      xonalar joylashtiriladi va matn buyrug'i bilan nomlanadi. Trim yordamida ortiqcha
      chiziqlar tozalanadi.
    </p>
    <p class="src">manba: Jay Cad (YouTube), <a href="https://www.youtube.com/jaycad">youtube.com/jaycad</a></p>

    <h3>3-bo'lim — Saqlash va fayl formatlari (Main File Formats, Lecture 16)</h3>
    <p>
      Ushbu bo'limda Jay Cad'ning kursining 3-bo'limi (Main File Formats) darsidan foydalaning:
      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/jaycad">youtube.com/jaycad</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Turli vaziyatlar uchun qaysi formatdan foydalanish (masalan, boshqa dasturga o'tkazishda
      .dxf) tushuntiriladi. To'g'ri format tanlash keyinchalik fayllarni yo'qotishdan saqlaydi.
    </p>
    <p class="src">manba: Jay Cad (YouTube), <a href="https://www.youtube.com/jaycad">youtube.com/jaycad</a></p>

    <h3>4-bo'lim — Qavat rejasini detallashtirish (Detailing the Floor Plan, Lectures 17–39)</h3>
    <p>
      Ushbu bo'limda Jay Cad'ning kursining 4-bo'limi (Creating Openings → Finishing Floor Plan)
      darslaridan foydalaning: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/jaycad">youtube.com/jaycad</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Bu eng uzun bo'lim — qavat rejasi to'liq mebel, jihoz va o'simliklar bilan to'ldiriladi.
      Layers va Blocks tizimi tartibni saqlash uchun asosiy vosita sifatida tushuntiriladi.
    </p>
    <p class="src">manba: Jay Cad (YouTube), <a href="https://www.youtube.com/jaycad">youtube.com/jaycad</a></p>

    <h3>5-bo'lim — Chop qilish uchun loyiha sozlamalari (Project Setup For Printing, Lectures 40–47)</h3>
    <p>
      Ushbu bo'limda Jay Cad'ning kursining 5-bo'limi (Paper Space → Using Titleblock with
      Attributes) darslaridan foydalaning:
      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/jaycad">youtube.com/jaycad</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Chizmani ekrandan qog'ozga (PDF) chiqarish uchun Paper Space va Viewport tushunchalari
      o'rganiladi. Titleblock yaratib, masshtabni qulflash orqali bir nechta varaqli loyiha
      tayyorlanadi.
    </p>
    <p class="src">manba: Jay Cad (YouTube), <a href="https://www.youtube.com/jaycad">youtube.com/jaycad</a></p>

    <h3>6-bo'lim — Qo'shimcha chizmalar (Adding Additional Drawings, Lectures 48–67)</h3>
    <p>
      Ushbu bo'limda Jay Cad'ning kursining 6-bo'limi (Drawing the Roof Plan → Putting the
      Final Set Together) darslaridan foydalaning:
      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/jaycad">youtube.com/jaycad</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Bitta loyiha doirasida turli chizma turlari (tom rejasi, fasat, kesim, ichki ko'rinish)
      qanday chizilishi va ularning o'zaro mosligi ko'rsatiladi. Oxirida barcha chizmalar bitta
      yakuniy to'plamga birlashtiriladi.
    </p>
    <p class="src">manba: Jay Cad (YouTube), <a href="https://www.youtube.com/jaycad">youtube.com/jaycad</a></p>
  </section>

  <a href="/bog-lanish" class="start-btn" style="margin-top:2rem;" data-i18n="ac.buy">Kursni sotib olish →</a>
  <a href="/kurslar" class="enroll" style="margin-left:1rem;" data-i18n="ac.all">← Barcha kurslar</a>

  <Quiz title="O'z bilimingizni tekshiring" titleI18n="ac.quizTitle" questions={questions} />
</article>
<TelegramCTA />

